## Notes: Automated supply lines: sells junk and repairs your gear at any vendor, with a quartermaster's report. Remembers where every repair vendor you open stands and lends that book to Commander Orders, so Go to Nearest Repair and Go to Nearest Vendor (and Commander Adjutant's alerts) point the Commander Orders arrow at the closest one, Questie's vendors included.
